    "insDashNote": {
      "fill": "green",
      "maxH": 700,
      "page": "insights",
      "text": "How the dashboard works\n\n• Hero: current footprint vs last time.\n• One range filter (3 months / 6 months / 1 year / All) above everything — tiles and charts update together.\n• Tiles: average per month, lowest month, CO₂ saved.\n• Footprint over time: line chart with your goal line; tap or tab to a point for its exact value; 'View as table' shows the same numbers.\n• Where it comes from: latest result, biggest source highlighted.\n• How each area is changing: a small trend per category with ↓ / ↑ vs last time.\n• One green hue, so no colours to learn; works in light and dark mode.",
      "w": 440,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 0
    },
    "insPlanNote": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 700,
      "page": "insights",
      "text": "Plan status (6 Oct)\n\n• Frontend Days 1–7 are built (UI flow, chat assessment, results, history, charts).\n• Day 8 API integration is waiting on the backend — the service is ready and switched on with one setting.\n• Backend not started yet; it's blocked first by the emission factors (dependency).\n\nFull plan + status table: docs/development-plan.md in the carbon-footprint repo.",
      "w": 420,
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 2600
    },
    "insRow1": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 1800,
      "page": "insights",
      "text": "Where the charts screen lives in the app: Home → Carbon footprint → Insights",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300
    },
    "insRow2": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 3680,
      "page": "insights",
      "text": "Carbon insights — screen by screen (all 390 × 844)",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1000
    },
    "r2B2B": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "maxH": 900,
      "page": "review2",
      "text": "B2B (housing societies, corporates, schools)\n\nNot in the app today — there are no business accounts, only a mention on the landing page. If we add it, design changes:\n\n• Organisation account + roles (admin, member).\n• Org assessment: offices/sites, headcount, electricity & DG diesel, fleet, business travel, waste by stream — mapped to Scope 1/2/3.\n• Org dashboard: total + per-employee footprint, site breakdown, trend, member participation.\n• Members' personal results roll up anonymously (opt-in).\n• Team challenges + leaderboard, bulk KarmaVerse pickups.\n• Downloadable ESG / BRSR-ready report.\n• Desktop-first admin web; members keep the same mobile flow.",
      "w": 440,
      "x": 2520,
      "y": 2600
    },
    "r2Feedback": {
      "fill": "green",
      "maxH": 900,
      "page": "review2",
      "text": "Review feedback → what changed\n\n• 6 bottom tabs → 5 on mobile web (Alerts moved to a bell on Home, as on native). Native already has 4.\n• Carbon footprint now in Discover features (native + web).\n• Q1 uses the profile: work / college / everyday travel, plus city.\n• No Back button — the ✕ closes; 'Change' undoes your last answer.\n• Every question has tap options. Typing and voice are optional (voice works in the browser today; on phones the keyboard mic until in-app voice is added).\n• 25 questions across 7 topics (Shopping added); follow-ups only when relevant.\n• Logged out: teaser on the landing page; using it needs login (results are personal and saved). After login you land back on Carbon footprint.\n• Push + email: invite and monthly check-in. Tapping a push now opens its screen.",
      "w": 440,
      "x": 2780,
      "y": 0
    },
